<html lang="en">
 <head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>My Personal Blog</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/src/styles/main.css" />
 </head>
 <body class="antialiased">
  <div id="top-progress-container" class="fixed top-0 left-0 w-full h-1 z-2000">
   <div id="top-progress-bar" class="h-full bg-brand w-0"></div>
  </div>
  <header
   class="hero-parallax relative h-[60vh] min-h-125 flex items-end justify-center py-8 text-white overflow-hidden shadow-md"
   style="--bg-url: url('/src/assets/images/india-header.jpg');"
  >
   <!-- Background Layer (Parallaxed) -->
   <div
    class="parallax-bg absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-cover bg-center bg-no-repeat pointer-events-none"
   ></div>

   <!-- Content Layer (Parallax Fade/Translate) -->
   <div class="parallax-content relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 pb-10">
    <h1 class="text-h1-fluid font-extrabold tracking-tight mb-4 leading-tight">
     Cycling India and Other Adventures
    </h1>
    <p class="text-lead-fluid mb-4 text-slate-100 font-medium">
     A
     <strong>4,000</strong>
     mile (<strong>6,437</strong>
     km) cycle ride around
     <strong>India</strong>
     taking in the
     <strong>West Coast</strong>, the
     <strong>Munaar mountains</strong>, the
     <strong>East Coast</strong>
     and the
     <strong>Siddhartha Highway, (Nepal)</strong>
     ending in
     <strong>Pokhara, (Nepal)</strong>.
    </p>
   </div>
  </header>
  <main class="max-w-4xl mx-auto py-12 px-4">
    <section class="mt-6 mb-20 border-b border-slate-200 pb-10">
    <p class="text-lead-fluid leading-relaxed">Starting in <strong>Delhi</strong>, cycling to <strong>Agra</strong> (<strong><em>Taj Mahal</em></strong>), then down to <strong>Sawai Madhapur</strong> (<strong><em>Ranthambore National Park</em></strong>), and ending the northern section in <strong>Kota</strong>. From there I took the train to <strong>Mumbai</strong> and cycled to <strong>Goa</strong> following the mountainous but scenic <em>west coast</em>. From <strong>Goa</strong> I continued down the mostly flat and easy pedaling <em>west coast</em> to <strong>Vakala</strong>. From <strong>Vakala</strong> I turned towards the mountains to <strong>Munnar</strong> and from there heading east to <strong>Madurai,</strong> taking a bus from <strong>Madurai</strong> to <strong>Chennai</strong> and then cycling down to <strong>Pondicherry</strong>. From <strong>Pondicherry</strong> I cycled the surprisingly quite and <em>easy pedaling</em> <em>east coast</em> to <strong>Puri</strong> and <strong>Bhubaneshwar,</strong> from here taking the train to <strong>Varanasi.</strong> After recovering the <em>lost cycle</em> from the train journey I cycled the short distance to <strong>Nepal</strong> and then cycled the <em>Himalayan foothills</em> ending my cycle ride in <strong>Pokhara</strong>.
     </p>

    <img
     src="/src/assets/images/india-map.png"
     alt="Delhi to Agra - Lost in India"
     class="w-2xl mx-auto my-10 rounded-lg shadow-sm"
    />
   <p class="text-lead-fluid leading-relaxed">Read about the <em>easy</em> and <em>hard</em> cycling, the time I got <em>lost</em>, the time I travelled <em>second class</em> on the train (<em>something you only do once</em>), the wonderful <strong>Goa.</strong> The loneliness when off the <em>tourist track</em>, the <em>people</em>, their way of <em>life</em> and their <em>culture.</em> The <em>problems</em> I had with the bicycle and trains.</p>
     </section>

   <!-- Tag Filter Bar -->
   <section class="mb-8">
    <div id="tag-filters" class="flex flex-wrap gap-2">
     <button
      data-tag="all"
      class="tag-btn bg-slate-900 text-white px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full text-sm font-medium transition"
     >
      All Posts
     </button>
    </div>
   </section>

   <!-- Posts Grid -->
   <section>
    <div id="posts-grid" class="grid gap-6 md:grid-cols-2">
     <!-- Rendered dynamically via JavaScript -->
    </div>
   </section>
  </main>
  {{> front-footer }} {{> backtop }}
  <script type="module" src="/src/scripts/gallery.js"></script>
   <script type="module" src="/src/scripts/main.js"></script>

 </body>
</html>